    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>--STORY--</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There once was a kingdom filled with bliss and spirit called Astaria. It was a safe place for families to live and children to play. But one day, it suffered a dreadful fate brought to it by a terrible creature and the cult surrounding it. They are called <strong>the Cursed Order</strong>.  <br>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674270/extras/3a498f7eaa34bcd7c73db4e5750a59d5.avif?t=1730210086\" width=568 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find what your fate entails as a powerful teenage boy who lost his memories before being found by the revolution camp. As you adventure along, meeting charming characters on the way in this story-rich, delightful game full of fun dialogue while chaos ensues, relive the memories of someone and see shadows that lurk around where death reeks the most.\u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674270/extras/f08f56a61a75fc0b0f13d42eb8d88b79.avif?t=1730210086\" width=544 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who, truly, are you? Why would this cult free such a wretched beast? Why were you selected to have such powers? Why is there a low-budget dog? Will the revolution camp be able to truly stop this government once and for all? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>--FEATURES \u1559(`\u25bf\u00b4)\u1557--</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-NEGOTIATE WITH ENEMIES!<br><br>-MEET LOW BUDGET DOG! <br><br>-BEAT UP VEGETABLES WITH RHYTHM MINIGAME! <br><br>-FIGHT AGAINST A LITERAL CULT?!?!? <br><br>-WATCH CHILDREN'S HAIRCUTS GET DEMOLISHED! <br><br>-FIND YOUR MENTALLY UNSTABLE SIBLING!<br><br>-Don\u2019t eat ants. (please).<br><br>-GET EXECUTED TOMORROW!<br><br> -ALSO LOW BUDGET DOG CAN DANCE NOW!<br><br>-(For your own safety, <strong>do not interact</strong> with <strong>the green haired girl</strong>, she's pretty weird...).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674270/extras/e16f922f19ce78cf7e302f88221c6157.avif?t=1730210086\" width=300 height=350 /></span></p>",
