ng>do not interact</strong> with <strong>the green haired girl</strong>, she's pretty weird...).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674270/extras/e16f922f19ce78cf7e302f88221c6157.avif?t=1730210086\" width=300 height=350 /></span></p>",
